# One production environment

There is a single Cloudflare Worker and a single D1 database, `freelancer-invoices`. That deployment is production. Do not add a local, preview, staging, or other copy of the app or database.

- Do not start `npm run dev`, `wrangler dev`, or any local server.
- Do not apply D1 migrations with `--local`. `--remote` targets this only database.
- Schema changes: `npx wrangler d1 migrations apply freelancer-invoices --remote`, then `npm run deploy`.
- Verify behavior on the deployed Cloudflare app.
